  <string name="fun_fact_prefix">Did you know? %s</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_1">Endcord comes with plugins from Endcord PC built in, all off until you turn them on.</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_2">Endcord speaks five languages: English, Turkish, Russian, Spanish and French.</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_3">Endcord checks GitHub for updates every 15 minutes and updates with a single tap.</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_4">The panda on Endcord\'s logo is asleep. Try not to wake it up.</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_5">Endcord on your phone uses the same translations as Endcord PC.</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_6">Having issues? Ask in the Endcord Discord server: discord.gg/endcord</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_7">Plugins that clash with each other are flagged, so you\'ll know before one stops working.</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_8">Endcord runs on the classic Discord app, with real Android views instead of React Native.</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_9">Safe mode turns every plugin off at once if something goes wrong.</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_10">Crash logs are saved in the Endcord/crashlogs folder.</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_11">Endcord is built on Aliucord, so most Aliucord plugins work too.</string>
  <string name="fun_fact_12">You can install Endcord more than once by using a different package name.</string>

